## Likely Failure Modes

| **Bug** | **Fix** |
|---------|---------|
| Stuck in geometry | Raycast before move, use safe margins |
| Fall through floor | Ground check distance < step height, multiple rays |
| Jitter on slopes | Use sloped ground definition, not heightmap |
| Memory spike pathfinding | Pool nodes, limit search depth |
| Teleporting over obstacles | NavMesh must be baked with proper agent radius |
| Frame-rate dependent jump arcs | Use fixed timestep or normalized physics |

